{"name":"Chrysophobia","hex":"#4a2200","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"chrysophobia","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An aversion to gold; aurophobia.","An aversion to the color orange."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/chrysophobia"}],"entries":[{"title":"Chromophobia","blocks":[{"text":"Chromophobia is a persistent, irrational fear of, or aversion to, colors and is usually a conditioned response. While actual clinical phobias to color are rare, colors can elicit hormonal responses and psychological reactions."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Bowl_of_Strawberries.jpg/330px-Bowl_of_Strawberries.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chromophobia"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Vase with lamps, Brown and beige textures, Rostov-on-Don, Russia","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/Vase_with_lamps%2C_Brown_and_beige_textures%2C_Rostov-on-Don%2C_Russia.jpg/500px-Vase_with_lamps%2C_Brown_and_beige_textures%2C_Rostov-on-Don%2C_Russia.jpg","ratio":1.5049019607843137,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vase_with_lamps,_Brown_and_beige_textures,_Rostov-on-Don,_Russia.jpg","share":0.101875},{"title":"Ford Madox Brown - The Last of England - Google Art Project","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/Ford_Madox_Brown_-_The_Last_of_England_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/500px-Ford_Madox_Brown_-_The_Last_of_England_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg","ratio":0.8934045986284792,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ford_Madox_Brown_-_The_Last_of_England_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg","share":0.080625},{"title":"Brown Rat (Rattus norvegicus) also called Norway Rat or Common Rat -with food container - Mathias Baldwin Park, Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, USA","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/Brown_Rat_%28Rattus_norvegicus%29